    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ancient Cultures: Tikal's Realm, is a game of connecting cultures, which takes you back to the height of one of the greatest Mayan civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Be a historian lost in this culture, and enjoy all that this \u201cnew world\u201d can offer you. Inserting yourself in a culture that you only know from old books is not easy, so do your part, train with the weapons of the time and prove yourself as a brave warrior, help in hunting and fishing, finding unusual challenges, quests for local natives, explore! Everything around you is a little mystical so adventure yourself out and you will be well rewarded. Be challenged by ancient gods. Each encounter with these mythological beings unlocks powers that help you on your journey, both in combat and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> All your training, effort and experiences will show you the path of your evolution, become stronger and dive headfirst into this incredible civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Walk the story to become a legend meet the Gods.<br><br>OBS: Development paused, if you are a publisher contact us</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ancient Cultures: Tikal's Realm, is a game of connecting cultures, which takes you back to the height of one of the greatest Mayan civilizations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Be a historian lost in this culture, and enjoy all that this \u201cnew world\u201d can offer you. Inserting yourself in a culture that you only know from old books is not easy, so do your part, train with the weapons of the time and prove yourself as a brave warrior, help in hunting and fishing, finding unusual challenges, quests for local natives, explore! Everything around you is a little mystical so adventure yourself out and you will be well rewarded. Be challenged by ancient gods. Each encounter with these mythological beings unlocks powers that help you on your journey, both in combat and exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> All your training, effort and experiences will show you the path of your evolution, become stronger and dive headfirst into this incredible civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Walk the story to become a legend meet the Gods.<br><br>OBS: Development paused, if you are a publisher contact us</p>",
